# Si el celular ya entró en un hotspot, el otro con el mismo nombre
# manda la MAC como usuario. La cambiamos por el usuario real y
# cerramos la sesión vieja de esa MAC para que Simultaneous-Use no la frene.
# Un cierre desde el portal (User-Request) no vuelve a entrar solo.
mac_hotspot {
	if (&User-Name =~ /^([0-9a-fA-F]{2}[:-]){5}[0-9a-fA-F]{2}$/) {
		update control {
			&Tmp-String-0 := "%{sql:SELECT realuser.username FROM radacct AS last JOIN radacct AS realuser ON REPLACE(REPLACE(LOWER(realuser.callingstationid), '-', ':'), ' ', '') = REPLACE(REPLACE(LOWER(last.callingstationid), '-', ':'), ' ', '') AND realuser.username REGEXP '^[A-Za-z0-9_.@+-]+$' AND realuser.username NOT LIKE 'T-%%' AND realuser.username NOT LIKE 'trial-%%' WHERE REPLACE(REPLACE(LOWER(last.callingstationid), '-', ':'), ' ', '') = REPLACE(LOWER('%{User-Name}'), '-', ':') AND last.acctstarttime = (SELECT MAX(newest.acctstarttime) FROM radacct AS newest WHERE REPLACE(REPLACE(LOWER(newest.callingstationid), '-', ':'), ' ', '') = REPLACE(LOWER('%{User-Name}'), '-', ':')) AND (last.acctstoptime IS NULL OR last.acctterminatecause IS NULL OR last.acctterminatecause <> 'User-Request') ORDER BY realuser.acctstarttime DESC LIMIT 1}"
		}

		if (&control:Tmp-String-0 && &control:Tmp-String-0 != "") {
			update request {
				&User-Name := "%{control:Tmp-String-0}"
			}
			update control {
				&Infinity-Mac-Auth := 1
			}
		}
	}
}

roaming_hotspot {
	if (&Calling-Station-Id =~ /^([0-9a-fA-F]{2}[:-]){5}[0-9a-fA-F]{2}$/ && &User-Name =~ /^[A-Za-z0-9_.@+-]+$/) {
		update control {
			&Tmp-String-0 := "%{sql:UPDATE radacct SET acctstoptime = NOW(), acctterminatecause = 'Lost-Carrier' WHERE username = '%{User-Name}' AND acctstoptime IS NULL AND REPLACE(REPLACE(LOWER(callingstationid), '-', ':'), ' ', '') = REPLACE(LOWER('%{Calling-Station-Id}'), '-', ':')}"
		}
	}
}

mac_hotspot_aceptar {
	if (&control:Infinity-Mac-Auth && &control:Cleartext-Password && (!&control:Auth-Type || &control:Auth-Type != Reject)) {
		update control {
			&Auth-Type := Accept
		}
	}
}
